shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"psG_tTwM0Wcddk9cW7yw_Q","review_id":"VZTMjJ3VM_UT0VGnaDWKPg","date":"2014-03-26T17:34:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9328678250312805,"text_excerpt":"I cannot wait to return to New Orleans so I can stop at Huck Finn's for breakfast! We got seated right away and had a super friendly server. Then again, I honestly have to say that every server I had in the city was friendly. I really appreciate that. Anywho, we started with mimosas and beignets. I ordered the skillet that comes with blackened shrimp. Oh Em Gee it was so good! I want it again. Right now! My mom had the omelet with boudin. Also very good. The grits were great. The biscuit was okay. The potatoes did not look like anything special so I am glad I did not get it. TIP: The bathrooms are in the hotel lobby next door and there is only one stall."},{"business_id":"psG_tTwM0Wcddk9cW7yw_Q","review_id":"YLCk3hm4LRPK9QpIk4XR0g","date":"2011-12-14T05:24:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9290280938148499,"text_excerpt":"THIS PLACE RULES! We were taking the Old New Orleans Distillery tour which picks up from here, so we went early to eat. It was some of the best food we had in NOLA. We had the boudin sausage nachos which were so delicious and could have been our entree. Highly recommend. I had the jambalaya wrap which was so amazing I might go buy one before I leave to take home. My husband ordered the mufaletta and it was great. HUUGE and quite flavorful. The food was spot on and deserves 5 stars by itself, but the service was AMAZING. I really wish I could remember our server's name because she gave us some of the best service we had in NOLA. Really cute and cozy, and when we went back to catch the shut..."},{"business_id":"psG_tTwM0Wcddk9cW7yw_Q","review_id":"x9x_0wl_YtFKgpjZSy0x7w","date":"2016-06-02T19:40:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.928796112537384,"text_excerpt":"Out of all the restaurants, I ate at in New Orleans, this was probably my favorite. I was a little worried about finding places to eat when I came on vacation, because I'm not a huge fan of seafood, but I still wanted to try some new food. My dad and I both ordered burgers, which were delicious, then an order of beignets, which were also equally delicious. I kind of regret not trying fried alligator or some of the other options on the menu that aren't exactly served where I live. If I ever came back to New Orleans (and I sure hope I do), I will come back to this restaurant and be more bold with my ordering choices. The service was wonderful and I loved the laid-back ambience of the restau..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"psG_tTwM0Wcddk9cW7yw_Q","photo_id":"j03XB0ePCRvDP-e_JlFF3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/j03XB0ePCRvDP-e_JlFF3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8840569257736206},{"business_id":"psG_tTwM0Wcddk9cW7yw_Q","photo_id":"oI0jVXJvwkENmPTJ_